# A17.var01 bounded independent postrun decision

Decision: **GO_BOUNDED_POSTRUN** for the single naturally completed native run. The authoritative read-only case signoff is `review/independent-postrun-go.json`, 1,795 bytes/SHA-256 `006e6cce0df04483bc6423707cb98a71aa6a23110d1e2c3918805c415461d70c`.

Native SSH transport receipt 1,462 bytes/SHA-256 `574c75a6b8de43b6f68f90dd130b068f68bbc8b87065448b650e79224391bddc` records one approved native dispatch, exit 0, original 112-byte stdout, and empty stderr. Four native commands and two child checkers completed. The root's first postrun seal-copy helper failed before sealing or copying because it required `closure.error` and `step_error` to be `null`; the actual PowerShell closure uses empty strings. That failure is preserved in original receipt 1,411 bytes/SHA-256 `132c90863f3c28863b47c512694c1c106d43d9199606a866fb2ded0782fe3abe`. It is a custody-helper NO_GO, separate from native completion.

The corrected seal-copy method changed only that one assertion to the `(null, empty string)` equivalence already present in the frozen independent reader. Its original custody receipt, 19,688 bytes/SHA-256 `eae7f788886f2a2f7a5e9f9855c41540867a75e4c97e579b9a5644f1de77afe0`, pins 39 unchanged read-only native/PURE/transport originals and 25 byte-identical read-only recovered run copies. It also confirms all 173 prelaunch source roles remained byte, mode and attribute stable.

The frozen independent audit method `tmp/a17-var01-independent-actual-postrun-audit-v101-20261008.py`, 9,750 bytes/SHA-256 `a3b288d940d9bd8596082e8cf1565ccea876ce7b871f89fd2342e25e2ccffeb5`, verified both helper receipts and their original streams, the exact one-line method repair, 61 mandatory host originals' current bytes and attributes, all 39 native originals/25 copies, transport timing and original streams, then invoked the unchanged independent reader once on the recovered directory. Its original root capture `tmp/i04-var09-root-review-proofs-v100-20261008/a17-var01-independent-actual-postrun-v101-20261008T173146853414Z-c60c9e64/receipt.json`, 1,372 bytes/SHA-256 `2d0d8ca4f9a342076c622dd568f7ede2de1391854fdb885fe2a52756b5f1cc9d`, exited 0 with empty stderr and stable methods. Original stdout says `GO_BOUNDED 60/52 4044 203/387 25 recovered 39 originals; wrapper-v100-NO_GO preserved`.

Acceptance is limited to the prospective primary same-station unit ordering, exact 60-line/52-timed log, 4,044 typed report cells, 203 authored and 387 export cells, strict converter grammar, and captured six-stage provenance. Seven alternate log forms remain diagnostic NO_GO. No native retry, accepted-parent checker rerun, or publication is authorized by this postrun decision. Publication requires separate closed-source/index/content/staged/remote gates.
